 to a specific aspect of the question", "zh": ""}, "connotation": {"en": "semi-formal, appropriate for IELTS context, signals topic management skills", "zh": ""}, "example": {"en": "Technology-wise This is a useful expression for expressing yourself naturally in English.", "zh": ""}, "cefr": "B1", "categoryIds": ["cat-016"], "subfunctionIds": [], "chainIds": [], "tags": ["topic-introduction"], "seeAlso": []}, {"id": "dm-be7a5cdeef", "expression": "When it comes to", "variants": [], "collocation": {"en": "Use at the start of a sentence to focus attention on a specific aspect", "zh": ""}, "contexts": {"en": "Used to narrow focus to a specific aspect of the question", "zh": ""}, "connotation": {"en": "semi-formal, appropriate for IELTS context, signals topic management skills", "zh": ""}, "example": {"en": "When it comes to cooking, I'm definitely more of a beginner than an expert.", "zh": ""}, "cefr": "B1", "categoryIds": ["cat-016"], "subfunctionIds": [], "chainIds": [], "tags": ["topic-introduction"], "seeAlso": []}, {"id": "dm-bfa5587a0a", "expression": "When it comes to ...,", "variants": [], "collocation": {"en": "When it comes to [topic], [general statement + elaboration]...", "zh": ""}, "contexts": {"en": "Template pattern: fill the placeholder with topic-relevant content. Used to Used to narrow focus to a specific aspect of the question", "zh": ""}, "connotation": {"en": "semi-formal, appropriate for IELTS context, signals topic management skills", "zh": ""}, "example": {"en": "When it comes to", "zh": ""}, "cefr": "B1", "categoryIds": ["cat-016"], "subfunctionIds": [], "chainIds": [], "tags": ["topic-introduction"], "seeAlso": []}, {"id": "dm-7b191d04fb", "expression": "When it comes to young people,", "variants": [], "collocation": {"en": "Use at the start of a sentence to focus attention on a specific aspect", "zh": ""}, "contexts": {"en": "Used to narrow focus to a specific aspect of the question", "zh": ""}, "connotation": {"en": "semi-formal, appropriate for IELTS context, signals topic management skills", "zh": ""}, "example": {"en": "When it comes to young people This is a useful expression for expressing yourself naturally in English.", "zh": ""}, "cefr": "B1", "categoryIds": ["cat-016"], "subfunctionIds": [], "chainIds": [], "tags": ["topic-introduction"], "seeAlso": []}, {"id": "dm-3ccf8dfa5e", "expression": "\"Thinking back to my parents' generation, they used to...\"", "variants": [], "collocation": {"en": "Use \"Thinking back to my parents' generation, they used to...\" to [situation-appropriate completion of the template]", "zh": ""}, "contexts": {"en": "Template pattern: fill the placeholder with topic-relevant content. Used to Used in Part 3 to demonstrate ability to discuss from multiple viewpoints", "zh": ""}, "connotation": {"en": "semi-formal, appropriate for IELTS context, demonstrates sophisticated analytical framing", "zh": ""}, "example": {"en": "\"Thinking back to my parents' generation, they used to...\" For example, this is a great way to introduce your point naturally.", "zh": ""}, "cefr": "B2", "categoryIds": ["cat-017"], "subfunctionIds": [], "chainIds": [], "tags": ["narrative", "memory"], "seeAlso": []}, {"id": "dm-b3e07238f1", "expression": "As far as I can recollect, I (did)", "variants": [], "collocation": {"en": "Use at the start of a clause to introduce a memory or past experience", "zh": ""}, "contexts": {"en": "Used when drawing on personal memories or past experiences", "zh": ""}, "connotation": {"en": "semi-formal, appropriate for IELTS context, natural narrative technique", "zh": ""}, "example": {"en": "As far as I can recollect, I (did) I remember it like it was yesterday \u2014 it was such a memorable experience.", "zh": ""}, "cefr": "B1", "categoryIds": ["cat-017"], "subfunctionIds": [], "chainIds": [], "tags": ["narrative", "memory"], "seeAlso": []}, {"id": "dm-e7ec4f0d10", "expression": "As far as I can remember,", "variants": [], "collocation": {"en": "Use at the start of a clause to introduce a memory or past experience", "zh": ""}, "contexts": {"en": "Used when drawing on personal memories or past experiences", "zh": ""}, "connotation": {"en": "semi-formal, appropriate for IELTS context, natural narrative technique", "zh": ""}, "example": {"en": "As far as I can remember I remember it like it was yesterday \u2014 it was such a memorable experience.", "zh": ""}, "cefr": "B1", "categoryIds": ["cat-017"], "subfunctionIds": [], "chainIds": [], "tags": ["narrative", "memory"], "seeAlso": []}, {"id": "dm-3156d01524", "expression": "As far as I can remember, when I was a little kid,", "variants": [], "collocation": {"en": "Position at the beginning of your response: As far as I can remember, when I was a little kid,", "zh": ""}, "contexts": {"en": "Used when drawing on personal memories or past experiences", "zh": ""}, "connotation": {"en": "semi-formal, appropriate for IELTS context, natural narrative technique", "zh": ""}, "example": {"en": "As far as I can remember, when I was a little kid I remember it like it was yesterday \u2014 it was such a memorable experience.", "zh": ""}, "cefr": "B2", "categoryIds": ["cat-017"], "subfunctionIds": [], "chainIds": [], "tags": ["narrative", "memory"], "seeAlso": []}, {"id": "dm-a883ad5168", "expression": "I vaguely remember that", "variants": [], "collocation": {"en": "Use at the start of a clause to introduce a memory or past experience", "zh": ""}, "contexts": {"en": "Used when drawing on personal memories or past experiences", "zh": ""}, "connotation": {"en": "semi-formal, appropriate for IELTS context, natural narrative technique", "zh": ""}, "example": {"en": "I vaguely remember that I remember it like it was yesterday \u2014 it was such a memorable experience.", "zh": ""}, "cefr": "B1", "categoryIds": ["cat-017"], "subfunctionIds": [], "chainIds": [], "tags": ["narrative", "memory"], "seeAlso": []}, {"id": "dm-3e9c5b4e0f", "expression": "I vaguely remember that,", "variants": [], "collocation": {"en": "Use at the start of a clause to introduce a memory or past experience", "zh": ""}, "contexts": {"en": "Used when drawing on personal memories or past experiences", "zh": ""}, "connotation": {"en": "semi-formal, appropriate for IELTS context, natural narrative technique", "zh": ""}, "example": {"en": "I vaguely remember that I remember it like it was yesterday \u2014 it was such a memorable experience.", "zh": ""}, "cefr": "B1", "categoryIds": ["cat-017"], "subfunctionIds": [], "chainIds": [], "tags": ["narrative", "memory"], "seeAlso": []}, {"id": "dm-159598e876", "expression": "If I recall correctly,", "variants": [], "collocation": {"en": "Use at the start of a clause to introduce a memory or past experience", "zh": ""}, "contexts": {"en": "Used when drawing on personal memories or past experiences", "zh": ""}, "connotation": {"en": "semi-formal, appropriate for IELTS context, natural narrative technique", "zh": ""}, "example": {"en": "If I recall correctly I remember it like it was yesterday \u2014 it was such a memorable experience.", "zh": ""}, "cefr": "B1", "categoryIds": ["cat-017"], "subfunctionIds": [], "chainIds": [], "tags": ["narrative", "memory"], "seeAlso": []}, {"id": "dm-8a5c9d5140", "expression": "If I remember correctly,", "variants": [], "collocation": {"en": "Use at the start of a clause to introduce a memory or past experience", "zh": ""}, "contexts": {"en": "Used when drawing on personal memories or past experiences", "zh": ""}, "connotation": {"en": "semi-formal, appropriate for IELTS context, natural narrative technique", "zh": ""}, "example": {"en": "If I remember correctly I remember it like it was yesterday \u2014 it was such a memorable experience.", "zh": ""}, "cefr": "B1", "categoryIds": ["cat-017"], "subfunctionIds": [], "chainIds": [], "tags": ["narrative", "memory"], "seeAlso": []}, {"id": "dm-da9a52abfe", "expression": "If my memory serves (me right),", "variants": [], "collocation": {"en": "Use at the start of a clause to introduce a memory or past experience", "zh": ""}, "contexts": {"en": "Used when drawing on personal memories or past experiences", "zh": ""}, "connotation": {"en": "semi-formal, appropriate for IELTS context, natural narrative technique", "zh": ""}, "example": {"en": "If my memory serves (me right) I remember it like it was yesterday \u2014 it was such a memorable experience.", "zh": ""}, "cefr": "B1", "categoryIds": ["cat-017"], "subfunctionIds": [], "chainIds": [], "tags": ["narrative", "memory"], "seeAlso": []}, {"id": "dm-05740d7bdf", "expression": "If my memory serves me right,", "variants": [], "collocation": {"en": "Use at the start of a clause to introduce a memory or past experience", "zh": ""}, "contexts": {"en": "Used when drawing on personal memories or past experiences", "zh": ""}, "connotation": {"en": "semi-formal, appropriate for IELTS context, natural narrative technique", "zh": ""}, "example": {"en": "If my memory serves me right I remember it like it was yesterday \u2014 it was such a memorable experience.", "zh": ""}, "cefr": "B1", "categoryIds": ["cat-017"], "subfunctionIds": [], "chainIds": [], "tags": ["narrative", "memory"], "seeAlso": []}, {"id": "dm-0682797496", "expression": "..., as it were", "variants": [], "collocation": {"en": "Use ..., as it were to [situation-appropriate completion of the template]", "zh": ""}, "contexts": {"en": "Template pattern: fill the placeholder with topic-relevant content. Used to Used to reference commonly understood facts or prior conversation", "zh": ""}, "connotation": {"en": "semi-formal, appropriate for IELTS context, builds common ground with listener", "zh": ""}, "example": {"en": "..., as it were For example, this is a great way to introduce your point naturally.", "zh": ""}, "cefr": "B1", "categoryIds": ["cat-018"], "subfunctionIds": [], "chainIds": [], "tags": ["shared-knowledge"], "seeAlso": []}, {"id": "dm-d4f5cde63c", "expression": "..., in a manner of speaking", "variants": [], "collocation": {"en": "Use ..., in a manner of speaking to [situation-appropriate completion of the template]", "zh": ""}, "contexts": {"en": "Template pattern: fill the placeholder with topic-relevant content. Used to Used to reference commonly understood facts or prior conversation", "zh": ""}, "connotation": {"en": "semi-formal, appropriate for IELTS context, builds common ground with listener", "zh": ""}, "example": {"en": "..., in a manner of speaking For example, this is a great way to introduce your point naturally.", "zh": ""}, "cefr": "B1", "categoryIds": ["cat-018"], "subfunctionIds": [], "chainIds": [], "tags": ["shared-knowledge"], "seeAlso": []}, {"id": "dm-7f7adb87c9", "expression": "..., so to speak", "variants": [], "collocation": {"en": "Use ..., so to speak to [situation-appropriate completion of the template]", "zh": ""}, "contexts": {"en": "Template pattern: fill the placeholder with topic-relevant content. Used to Used to reference commonly understood facts or prior conversation", "zh": ""}, "connotation": {"en": "semi-formal, appropriate for IELTS context, builds common ground with listener", "zh": ""}, "example": {"en": "..., so to speak For example, this is a great way to introduce your point naturally.", "zh": ""}, "cefr": "B1", "categoryIds": ["cat-018"], "subfunctionIds": [], "chainIds": [], "tags": ["shared-knowledge"], "seeAlso": []}, {"id": "dm-6eb065df05", "expression": "And bear in mind,", "variants": [], "collocation": {"en": "Use to reference commonly understood information or prior discussion", "zh": ""}, "contexts": {"en": "Used to reference commonly understood facts or prior conversation", "zh": ""}, "connotation": {"en": "semi-formal, appropriate for IELTS context, builds common ground with listener", "zh": ""}, "example": {"en": "And bear in mind It's something that most people would agree with.", "zh": ""}, "cefr": "B1", "categoryIds": ["cat-018"], "subfunctionIds": [], "chainIds": [], "tags": ["shared-knowledge"], "seeAlso": []}, {"id": "dm-2cbbb3598a", "expression": "As I have mentioned,", "variants": [], "collocation": {"en": "Use to reference commonly understood information or prior discussion", "zh": ""}, "contexts": {"en": "Used to reference commonly understood facts or prior conversation", "zh": ""}, "connotation": {"en": "semi-formal, appropriate for IELTS context, builds common ground with listener", "zh": ""}, "example": {"en": "As I have mentioned It's something that most people would agree with.", "zh": ""}, "cefr": "B1", "categoryIds": ["cat-018"], "subfunctionIds": [], "chainIds": [], "tags": ["shared-knowledge"], "seeAlso": []}, {"id": "dm-271fe2cbc9", "expression": "It's common sense that", "variants": [], "collocation": {"en": "Use to reference commonly understood information or prior discussion", "zh": ""}, "contexts": {"en": "Used to reference commonly understood facts or prior conversation", "zh": ""}, "connotation": {"en": "semi-formal, appropriate for IELTS context, builds common ground with listener", "zh": ""}, "example": {"en": "It's common sense that It's something that most people would agree with.", "zh": ""}, "cefr": "B1", "categoryIds": ["cat-018"], "subfunctionIds": [], "chainIds": [], "tags": ["shared-knowledge"], "seeAlso": []}, {"id": "dm-58d1d57016", "expression": "We all know that", "variants": [], "collocation": {"en": "Use to reference commonly understood information or prior discussion", "zh": ""}, "contexts": {"en": "Used to reference commonly understood facts or prior conversation", "zh": ""}, "connotation": {"en": "semi-formal, appropriate for IELTS context, builds common ground with listener", "zh": ""}, "example": {"en": "We all know that It's something that most people would agree with.", "zh": ""}, "cefr": "B1", "categoryIds": ["cat-018"], "subfunctionIds": [], "chainIds": [], "tags": ["shared-knowledge"], "seeAlso": []}, {"id": "dm-c709672894", "expression": "especially", "variants": [], "collocation": {"en": "Use at the start of a clause to signal personal viewpoint", "zh": ""}, "contexts": {"en": "Used to mark your answer as personal viewpoint, especially in Part 1 and Part 3", "zh": ""}, "connotation": {"en": "semi-formal, appropriate for IELTS context, clearly marks personal stance", "zh": ""}, "example": {"en": "especially technology has fundamentally changed the way we communicate with each other.", "zh": ""}, "cefr": "A2", "categoryIds": ["cat-019"], "subfunctionIds": [], "chainIds": [], "tags": ["specification"], "seeAlso": []}, {"id": "dm-2ef2852ad9", "expression": "Going into details,", "variants": [], "collocation": {"en": "Use before a precise detail or clarification", "zh": ""}, "contexts": {"en": "Used when you want to give precise details rather than general statements", "zh": ""}, "connotation": {"en": "semi-formal, appropriate for IELTS context, adds precision and detail", "zh": ""}, "example": {"en": "Going into details This is a useful expression for expressing yourself naturally in English.", "zh": ""}, "cefr": "B1", "categoryIds": ["cat-019"], "subfunctionIds": [], "chainIds": [], "tags": ["specification"], "seeAlso": []}, {"id": "dm-8dd2f0530d", "expression": "Precisely speaking,", "variants": [], "collocation": {"en": "Use before a precise detail or clarification", "zh": ""}, "contexts": {"en": "Used when you want to give precise details rather than general statements", "zh": ""}, "connotation": {"en": "semi-formal, appropriate for IELTS context, adds precision and detail", "zh": ""}, "example": {"en": "Precisely speaking This is a useful expression for expressing yourself naturally in English.", "zh": ""}, "cefr": "B1", "categoryIds": ["cat-019"], "subfunctionIds": [], "chainIds": [], "tags": ["specification"], "seeAlso": []}, {"id": "dm-72dc85c7c8", "expression": "Specifically speaking,", "variants": [], "collocation": {"en": "Use before a precise detail or clarification", "zh": ""}, "contexts": {"en": "Used when you want to give precise details rather than general statements", "zh": ""},